<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>The Rooted Exchange | Plant Clipping PenPals</title>
  <style>
    /* RESET & BASE */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --primary-green: #2d6a4f;
      --light-green: #40916c;
      --soft-green: #d8f3dc;
      --earth: #bc4749;
      --cream: #fefae0;
      --dark: #1b4332;
      --text: #2d3436;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--cream);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
    
    /* LAYOUT */
    .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
    section { padding: 4rem 0; }
    
    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-green), var(--light-green));
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 6rem 1rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%; left: -50%; width: 200%; height: 200%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
      animation: pulse 8s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.5; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 0.8; }
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--earth);
      color: white;
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    .cta-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    
    /* ARCHWAY SECTION */
    .archway {
      background: white;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .archway h2 {
      color: var(--primary-green);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .archway p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      color: #555;
    }
    .steps {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    .step {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 250px;
      max-width: 300px;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: var(--soft-green);
      border-radius: 15px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .step-number {
      position: absolute;
      top: -15px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--primary-green);
      color: white;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .step h3 { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--dark); }
    
    /* GARDEN PREVIEW */
    .garden-preview {
      background: var(--soft-green);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .garden-preview h2 {
      color: var(--dark);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .channel-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .channel-card {
      background: white;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .channel-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); }
    .channel-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .channel-name { font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary-green); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .channel-desc { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #666; }
    
    /* DISCORD EMBED SECTION */
    .discord-section {
      background: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }
    .discord-section h2 {
      color: var(--primary-green);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .discord-note {
      background: var(--soft-green);
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    
    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      background: var(--dark);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }
    footer p { opacity: 0.9; }
    .footer-links { margin-top: 1rem; }
    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--soft-green);
      margin: 0 1rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: white; }
    
    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
      .hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; }
      .steps { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
      .step { max-width: 100%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>🌱 The Rooted Exchange</h1>
      <p>A global community of plant parents swapping cuttings, sharing wisdom, and growing together—one clipping at a time.</p>
      <a href="YOUR_DISCORD_INVITE_LINK_HERE" class="cta-button" target="_blank">
        Join the Exchange
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE ARCHWAY -->
  <section class="archway">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Enter Through The Archway</h2>
      <p>Welcome to a space where every cutting tells a story. Whether you're propagating your first pothos or hunting rare variegated gems, you belong here.</p>
      
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <h3>Browse the Trade Board</h3>
          <p>Check what's available—from beginner-friendly succulents to exotic tropicals. Find your next favorite plant friend.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <h3>Connect & Arrange</h3>
          <p>DM the poster, discuss shipping or local pickup, and agree on a fair swap. Trust and kindness are our currency.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <h3>Grow Together</h3>
          <p>Share your success in #trading-success, post your thriving plants in #plant-brag, and help newcomers in #plant-help.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GARDEN PREVIEW -->
  <section class="garden-preview">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Explore Our Garden</h2>
      <p>Inside The Rooted Exchange, every corner has its purpose. Here's where you'll spend your time:</p>
      
      <div class="channel-grid">
        <div class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">💬</div>
          <div class="channel-name">#general</div>
          <div class="channel-desc">Daily chatter, plant wins, and the occasional existential crisis about overwatering.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">🏆</div>
          <div class="channel-name">#plant-brag</div>
          <div class="channel-desc">Flex those healthy leaves. Show off your jungle mode. We're here to celebrate.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">🔄</div>
          <div class="channel-name">#trade-board</div>
          <div class="channel-desc">Post your cuttings, find your matches. Fair swaps only—no ghosts, please.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">🌿</div>
          <div class="channel-name">#plant-help</div>
          <div class="channel-desc">Yellowing leaves? Root rot? Drop a photo. Our collective brainpower has your back.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">🐾</div>
          <div class="channel-name">#pet-corner</div>
          <div class="channel-desc">Your plant babies aren't your only family. Show us your furry, feathered, and scaly friends.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">🎨</div>
          <div class="channel-name">#non-planty-hobbies</div>
          <div class="channel-desc">Because plant people have other obsessions too. Let's talk gaming, books, crafts, etc.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DISCORD CTA -->
  <section class="discord-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Root In?</h2>
      <p>Join hundreds of plant lovers worldwide. Free clippings, endless advice, and a community that genuinely cares.</p>
      <br/>
      <a href="YOUR_DISCORD_INVITE_LINK_HERE" class="cta-button" target="_blank">
        Enter The Rooted Exchange
      </a>
      <div class="discord-note">
        💡 Tip: Introduce yourself in #welcome and grab your roles!
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>Made with ❤️ and chlorophyll for plant parents everywhere.</p>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="#rules">Rules</a> •
        <a href="KAITLYN_SOCIAL_LINK_HERE" target="_blank">Follow Kaitlyn</a> •
        <a href="#">About Us</a>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.7;">
        © 2026 The Rooted Exchange. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
